{"ts":"2026-11-19T05:43:41Z","sha":"c5ae6f4d9aaa83163e6cac286fce5022e5b00c39","round":1,"kind":"finding","file":"_acceptance/split-log-ledger/rang/measure.sh","title":"measure.sh hard-codes the owner's local checkout path, unlike the other measures that work out the repo root","severity":"low","source":"conventions","inContract":false,"acRef":"","plain":"Only the repo owner's machine can re-run the 'before' count of merge conflicts, and the file shows a local username in a public repo. Nothing changes for people using the product.","can_cu":"Low impact: no data loss and no effect on users, the measurement is a one-off already recorded, and the contract already states the limit.","proposal":"known-limits","khongBacBo":true,"unverified":false,"unclassified":false}
{"ts":"2026-11-19T05:43:41Z","sha":"c5ae6f4d9aaa83163e6cac286fce5022e5b00c39","round":1,"kind":"finding","file":"_acceptance/split-log-ledger/rang/ve-truoc-test.mjs","title":"Hình dạng 1 (đo chỉ dẫn thay vì đầu ra): ve-truoc-test đọc kế hoạch `make -n check-quick` rồi tự vẽ bằng `make derived`, không đo việc check-quick thật sự vẽ trước khi chạy test","severity":"medium","source":"measurement","inContract":false,"acRef":"","plain":"The check only confirms the quick check is ordered to draw the log before the tests, not that a real run does so. A faulty setup could pass the check yet fail on the first real run, where it would show up immediately.","can_cu":"Medium-low impact: a miss would surface as a visibly failing CI run that can simply be re-run or fixed, with no data lost, and the CI job itself is the real safety net.","proposal":"known-limits","khongBacBo":true,"unverified":false,"unclassified":false}
{"ts":"2026-11-19T05:43:41Z","sha":"c5ae6f4d9aaa83163e6cac286fce5022e5b00c39","round":1,"kind":"finding","file":"_acceptance/split-log-ledger/rang/measure.sh","title":"Hình dạng 6 (đường dẫn hardcode ROOT): measure.sh cd vào bản checkout chính của tác giả","severity":"low","source":"measurement","inContract":false,"acRef":"","plain":"The recorded 'before' conflict count can only be reproduced from the owner's main checkout, not from another copy or machine. Product users are unaffected.","can_cu":"Low impact: it only affects a historical measurement already saved, nothing is lost, and the contract discloses it.","proposal":"known-limits","khongBacBo":true,"unverified":false,"unclassified":false}
{"ts":"2026-11-19T05:43:41Z","sha":"c5ae6f4d9aaa83163e6cac286fce5022e5b00c39","round":1,"kind":"finding","file":"_acceptance/split-log-ledger/rang/two-way.mjs","title":"Hình dạng 2 (fixture viết tay đúng khuôn bên đọc): ca «entry dated before the split» của so-log tự viết tệp mục thay vì sinh bằng writer","severity":"low","source":"measurement","inContract":false,"acRef":"","plain":"One test case builds its sample log entry by hand instead of with the real tool, so it could miss a future change in the entry format. Today it matches, and users see no effect.","can_cu":"Low impact: it is a hypothetical future drift in a test, nothing is lost for users, and the other cases already go through the real tool.","proposal":"known-limits","khongBacBo":true,"unverified":false,"unclassified":false}
